        "department": null,
        "description": "This course aims to introduce students to the basic issues and debates that arise within the philosophy of technology. These include:\n1) What is Technology? How does it relate to society?\n2) How do we conceive the relation between technology and science?\n3) How do we understand the relationship between technology and nature?\n4) Is the distinction between the \u2018real\u2019 and the \u2018virtual\u2019 still tenable?\n5) Do visions of technologically dystopian or utopian futures overestimate the possibilities of technology?",
        "prerequisites_mandatory": [
            "Introduction to Philosophy"
        ],
